# Next regenerates this on every dev/build, rewriting its routes import between
# .next/dev/types and .next/types — so it churns on every mode switch. Verified
# that type checking passes without it, even on a clean tree with no build
# output: this app uses its own <img> shim, so nothing depends on
# next/image-types.
